AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/bank_setup_render_and_edit.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-lt[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-lt/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bob bank config report and located diagnostics[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config-report[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config-report: add the read-only bob bank config report with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fingerprint, provenance, usage, and fully located findings, fixing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-cli-lq.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared YAML span primitives and the bank entry editor[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]config-spans[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config-spans: extract album-agnostic span primitives and build a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]style-preserving, entry-granular bank: editor library.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The Setup header on the bank hub[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]setup-header[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config-report[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]setup-header: render the collapsed/expanded Setup header in both views, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope the bank row hide to it, and paint Source-mode lint.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob bank config update with category and group ops[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]writer-core[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config-report, config-spans[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer-core: add the guarded config writer envelope, transaction, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]inverse ops, hotkey-shift consequences, and category/group ops.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Account, rule, and setting ops with the migration refusals[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]writer-ops[dim] · [dim][/dim]after writer-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]writer-ops: add account, rule, and stale_after ops plus the typed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refusals that keep history-bearing edits in YAML.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]New category from the Category card[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]category-new[dim] · [dim][/dim]after setup-header, writer-core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]category-new: add the plugin config-update service and shared session, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the + New category stage that adds then files the row.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The Bank Setup card with the Categories section[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]setup-card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after category-new[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]setup-card: build the keyboard-first Setup card shell, Categories [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gestures, Undo, the YAML excursion, and entry points.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Accounts, Rules, and Checks in the Setup card[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]setup-card-more[dim] · [dim][/dim]after setup-card, writer-ops[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]setup-card-more: add the Accounts, Rules, and Checks sections and their [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gestures to the Setup card.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-lt","llm_provider":"codex","model":"g